		(property "Description" "Skyworks (Silicon Labs) Si4735-D60-GU. Digital audio out is a SLAVE interface: DFS (pin 2) and DCLK (GPO3, pin 3) are inputs. Pins 10 / 11 unused: tie to GND (datasheet). 6 / 7 NC. GPO1 (5) left open: it must be high or open at reset (2-wire bus mode, internal pull-up). LOUT / ROUT unused: POWER_UP OPMODE 0xB0 (digital only; 0xB5 analog + digital is not offered on the Si4735 in FM, AN332 p.15)"
